  'ts.s7b': 'Access may be suspended or terminated without prior notice for violating these terms or engaging in unlawful or fraudulent activity.',
  'ts.s8t': 'Changes to the Terms',
  'ts.s8b': 'We may revise these terms at any time. Changes take effect immediately upon posting on this page. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.',
  'ts.s9t': 'Governing Law',
