  'at.hiwEyebrow': 'How it works',
  'at.hiw1': 'Capture. Analyse.', 'at.hiw2': 'Act with confidence.',
  'at.sp1t': 'Auto Capture', 'at.sp1d': 'Connect your trading platform or upload charts. The assistant captures and monitors your markets automatically - no manual data entry.',
  'at.sp2t': 'AI Analysis', 'at.sp2d': 'The AI identifies patterns, support/resistance levels, trend direction, and momentum shifts - with confidence scoring on every finding.',
  'at.sp3t': 'Get Signals', 'at.sp3d': 'Receive structured recommendations with entry price, stop-loss, take-profit, and risk/reward ratio. Act on them or ignore them - you decide.',
  'at.whyEyebrow': 'Why choose Tradvio AI',
  'at.why1': 'An assistant that', 'at.why2': 'never clocks out.',
  'at.w1t': '24/7 Monitoring', 'at.w1d': 'Around-the-clock market coverage. The AI never sleeps, never fatigues, and never misses a setup because it was away from the screen.',
  'at.w2t': 'Instant Analysis', 'at.w2d': 'Chart analysis in seconds, not hours. Upload a screenshot and get a full technical breakdown while your coffee is still warm.',
  'at.w3t': 'Risk Management', 'at.w3d': 'Stop-loss and position sizing recommendations built into every signal. The AI protects your capital as it searches for opportunity.',
  'at.w4t': 'Multi-Platform', 'at.w4d': 'Works alongside TradingView, MetaTrader, Interactive Brokers, and other major platforms. One assistant for every market you trade.',
  'at.tfEyebrow': 'Timeframe analysis',
  'at.tf1': 'Built for every', 'at.tf2': 'trading style.',
  'at.tfn1': 'Scalping', 'at.tfd1': 'Micro-patterns, momentum shifts, and tight support/resistance. Ideal for fast execution and short holds.',
  'at.tfn2': 'Intraday', 'at.tfd2': 'Trend structure, VWAP relationships, and key levels. The sweet spot for most active traders.',
  'at.tfn3': 'Swing Setup', 'at.tfd3': 'Multi-day structures, trend channels, and flag patterns for trades held across sessions.',
  'at.tfn4': 'Position', 'at.tfd4': 'Major trend direction, weekly levels, and long-term formations for patient traders.',
  'at.tft1': 'Fastest', 'at.tft2': 'Most popular', 'at.tft3': 'Swing', 'at.tft4': 'Long-term',
  'at.bpT': 'Multi-timeframe best practice', 'at.bpD': 'Use the higher timeframe to read the trend and the lower timeframe to time your entry. The assistant analyses both simultaneously - so every signal comes with the full picture, not just one window.',
  'at.vmEyebrow': 'AI vs Manual',
  'at.vm1': 'Your attention has limits.', 'at.vm2': 'Your assistant doesn\'t.',
  'at.vmP1t': 'The problem: attention limits', 'at.vmP1d': 'Visual attention degrades after 20–30 minutes of chart watching. The setups you miss after hour two are often the best ones of the day.',
  'at.vmP2t': 'The problem: inconsistency', 'at.vmP2d': 'After a win you trade too big. After a loss you hesitate. Emotions change your methodology - and your results show it.',
  'at.vmS1t': 'The solution: AI + human', 'at.vmS1d': 'The AI handles scanning and level detection - like a tireless junior analyst. You provide context and make the final call. The best of both.',
  'at.faqEyebrow': 'FAQ',
  'at.faq1': 'AI trading assistant', 'at.faq2': 'questions.',
  'at.fq1': 'What is an AI trading assistant?', 'at.fa1': 'An AI trading assistant is software that watches the markets for you - analysing charts, spotting patterns, and delivering structured trade recommendations with entry points, stop-losses, and risk guidance. It does the searching; you make the final call.',
  'at.fq2': 'How does it work?', 'at.fa2': 'The assistant continuously monitors your charts and market data. When it spots a setup, it analyses the pattern, identifies support/resistance levels, and builds a complete trade plan with entry, exit, and risk levels - delivered to your dashboard in seconds.',
  'at.fq3': 'Does it replace manual trading?', 'at.fa3': 'No. The assistant is a research tool, not a replacement for your judgment. It handles the scanning and analysis so you can focus on decision-making. You always stay in control of every trade.',
  'at.fq4': 'Which platforms does it work with?', 'at.fa4': 'It works alongside TradingView, MetaTrader, Interactive Brokers, and other major trading platforms. Chart uploads are also supported - upload a screenshot and get analysis in seconds.',
  'at.fq5': 'How accurate is the AI analysis?', 'at.fa5': 'Our pattern recognition is validated at 94% accuracy on standard technical formations. But no tool is right every time - every signal includes a confidence score, and risk management is built into every recommendation.',
  'at.fq6': 'Which markets are covered?', 'at.fa6': 'Stocks, crypto, forex, commodities, indices, ETFs, and CFDs. The assistant analyses 26+ indicators across multiple timeframes for every market you trade.',
  'at.close1': 'Ready to get your', 'at.close2': 'AI trading assistant?',
  'at.closeSub': 'Free to start. No credit card required.',
  'at.closeCta': 'Get Started Free →',
  'at.closeNote': 'AI analysis can be incorrect. Trading involves risk - only trade with capital you can afford to lose.',
